    <h2>4. New York Business Hours &amp; Finance</h2>
    <p>
      New York Time is the default reference for global financial markets. 
      The core hours of Wall Street dictate the operational speed of stock exchanges, brokerage firms, and investment banks worldwide.
    </p>

    <!-- Visual Asset 4: Wall Street Business Hours Infographic -->
    <figure style="margin: 2.5rem 0; text-align: center; border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--panel);">
