    <h2>5. New York and Global Time Comparisons</h2>
    <p>
      Because New York transitions between standard and daylight saving offsets, its time differences with other global cities shift seasonally.
    </p>

    <!-- Visual Asset 5: New York vs World Time Comparison -->
